          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 SW                  MARSWORTH           CHURCH LANE 6/94                                          Barn l0m. to east of                                               The Old Manor - GV                                            II Barn.  C17-C18.  Timber frame and weatherboard with some brick infill in left bays.  Brick plinth with some flint in left bay.  Half-hipped thatch roof. 6 bays.  Cart entry to left of centre, small pair of raised board doors in left bay, 2 other board doors.  Glazed strip window to left bays, 3 other windows.  Interior has queen post trusses, some altered, and angle braces. Listing NGR: SP9195614502"
    }
  ],
